  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "There is a newer Jena 2.x release available (2.13.x). This is a ticket to track updating to that version.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "A significant difference with this version is that all String literals now have a defined DatatypeURI. In RDF 1.1, there is no difference between \"abc\" and \"abc\"^^<",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": ">, and this change simply makes that more explicit in the serialization.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "2.13.0 also has artifacts built as OSGi bundles.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
